<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>AcWing on timerring</title><link>https://blogs.timerring.com/tags/acwing/</link><description>Recent content in AcWing on timerring</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 04 Jan 2024 20:30:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blogs.timerring.com/tags/acwing/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>链表的常见知识：构造、删除与反转</title><link>https://blogs.timerring.com/posts/acwing-linked-list-basics/</link><pubDate>Thu, 04 Jan 2024 20:30:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blogs.timerring.com/posts/acwing-linked-list-basics/</guid><description>&lt;p>从单链表的构造与遍历入手，练习常数时间删除节点，以及迭代和递归反转链表。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>AcWing 823. 排列</title><link>https://blogs.timerring.com/posts/acwing-823-permutations/</link><pubDate>Wed, 03 Jan 2024 20:30:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blogs.timerring.com/posts/acwing-823-permutations/</guid><description>&lt;p>使用 DFS 和回溯按字典序枚举排列，对比从 0 和从 1 开始编号的两种实现。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>给定一个整数 n，将数字 1∼n 排成一排，将会有很多种排列方法。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>现在，请你按照字典序将所有的排列方法输出。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>AcWing 821、822. 跳台阶与走方格</title><link>https://blogs.timerring.com/posts/acwing-821-822-dfs-path-counting/</link><pubDate>Wed, 03 Jan 2024 16:13:24 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blogs.timerring.com/posts/acwing-821-822-dfs-path-counting/</guid><description>&lt;p>通过跳台阶和走方格两道题，理解递归搜索树、递归边界与方案计数。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>AcWing 779. 最长公共字符串后缀</title><link>https://blogs.timerring.com/posts/acwing-779-longest-common-suffix/</link><pubDate>Tue, 02 Jan 2024 20:30:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blogs.timerring.com/posts/acwing-779-longest-common-suffix/</guid><description>&lt;p>从字符串末尾逐位比较，在越界或不匹配时停止，求出多个字符串的最长公共后缀。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>给出若干个字符串，输出这些字符串的最长公共后缀。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>AcWing 777. 字符串乘方</title><link>https://blogs.timerring.com/posts/acwing-777-string-powers/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 2024 20:20:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blogs.timerring.com/posts/acwing-777-string-powers/</guid><description>&lt;p>枚举字符串长度的因数，通过重复前缀判断字符串的最大乘方次数。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;a href="https://www.acwing.com/problem/content/description/779/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">https://www.acwing.com/problem/content/description/779/&lt;/a>&lt;sup>&lt;a href="#ref-link-1" class="footnote-ref" id="ref-link-back-1">[1]&lt;/a>&lt;/sup>&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>AcWing 772. 只出现一次的字符</title><link>https://blogs.timerring.com/posts/acwing-772-first-unique-character/</link><pubDate>Sun, 31 Dec 2023 20:40:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blogs.timerring.com/posts/acwing-772-first-unique-character/</guid><description>&lt;p>先统计字符频次，再按原字符串顺序寻找第一个只出现一次的字符，并对比错误实现。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>给你一个只包含小写字母的字符串。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>请你判断是否存在只在字符串中出现过一次的字符。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>如果存在，则输出满足条件的字符中位置最靠前的那个。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>如果没有，输出 &lt;code>no&lt;/code>。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>AcWing 771. 字符串中最长的连续出现的字符</title><link>https://blogs.timerring.com/posts/acwing-771-longest-character-run/</link><pubDate>Sun, 31 Dec 2023 20:10:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blogs.timerring.com/posts/acwing-771-longest-character-run/</guid><description>&lt;p>按连续相同字符分段扫描字符串，记录最长段的字符与长度。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>求一个字符串中最长的连续出现的字符，输出该字符及其出现次数，字符串中无空白字符（空格、回车和 tab），如果这样的字符不止一个，则输出第一个。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>AcWing 756. 蛇形矩阵</title><link>https://blogs.timerring.com/posts/acwing-756-spiral-matrix/</link><pubDate>Sat, 30 Dec 2023 20:41:10 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blogs.timerring.com/posts/acwing-756-spiral-matrix/</guid><description>&lt;p>使用方向向量和边界判断，按回字蛇形顺序填充矩阵。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>输入两个整数 n 和 m，输出一个 n 行 m 列的矩阵，将数字 1 到 n×m 按照回字蛇形填充至矩阵中。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>具体矩阵形式可参考样例。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>AcWing 727. 菱形</title><link>https://blogs.timerring.com/posts/acwing-727-diamond/</link><pubDate>Fri, 29 Dec 2023 20:30:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blogs.timerring.com/posts/acwing-727-diamond/</guid><description>&lt;p>用曼哈顿距离判断字符是否位于菱形内部，完成菱形图案的输出。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>输入一个奇数 n，输出一个由 &lt;code>*&lt;/code> 构成的 n 阶实心菱形。&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>